# FORGEIQ — AI ENGINEERING FACTORY

## PRODUCT IDENTITY

Product name:

ForgeIQ

Product category:

Enterprise AI Engineering Factory / Harness Engineering Control Plane.

Primary positioning:

"We don't just build AI agents. We engineer how AI builds software."

ForgeIQ is a standalone, multi-tenant enterprise platform that defines, governs, executes, observes and continuously improves how AI engineers software.

ForgeIQ is NOT:

* a generic AI chatbot
* a simple agent marketplace
* a LangGraph Studio clone
* a Harness.io clone
* a collection of disconnected AI agents
* a visual workflow designer with fake execution
* a CI/CD dashboard with AI added
* a prompt management platform
* a simple pipeline builder
* a frontend-only workflow simulator

The product is an executable engineering system.

